msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"A lot of customers are lookin' for this so-called\r\n"
"\"Golden Agu\" lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I even saw it on TV, but I have a hard time believin'\r\n"
"it's genuine agu pork from Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I mean, this is prime pork we're talkin' here. It's not the\r\n"
"kind of meat you'd find at your average butcher shop either.\r\n"
"These pigs are limited to experimental livestock stations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"So, the other day, some of us Public Market vendors sat down together and "
"had a little talk about this \"Golden Agu,\" right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"We all pitched in and bought some just to try it, and you\r\n"
"know what? It doesn't smell or taste like genuine agu pork\r\n"
"in the slightest. It was as plain as could be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Now I hear there's a company sellin' this \"Golden Agu\" via mail order. "
"It's in a building just a hair northeast of a club called Flawless... "
"Office's on the second floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "It's imposters like these who are hurtin' the local Okinawan economy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"So if ya manage to track down these phony pork peddlers and give 'em what "
"for, I'd be willin' to give you a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "(So it's a little northeast of Flawless, all the way up on Hatsumatchi...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1904"
msgid "Market Worker"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1908"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""